# Project Completion & Implementation Roadmap
## ProjectFlow Edu 🚀
**Academic Project Lifecycle Management SaaS Platform**

---

## 1. Executive Summary

**ProjectFlow Edu** is a enterprise-grade, single-college SaaS platform engineered to bridge the critical gap between raw academic software projects and industry-standard Agile methodologies. By redesigning the traditional "Jira" paradigm to fit the administrative and evaluation rubrics of academic institutions, it transforms the chaos of final-year engineering projects into a streamlined, high-visibility Software Development Lifecycle (SDLC) pipeline.

This roadmap serves as the master blueprint for finalizing and deploying the platform within a strict **15-day development sprint**. It audits the current codebase (Node.js/Express backend, MySQL database, microservice-inspired Vite/React frontend), details critical gaps, outlines high-value future SaaS features, and maps out a day-by-day development schedule. The objective is to transition ProjectFlow Edu from a high-fidelity functional prototype into a robust, secure, and production-ready college deployment serving thousands of students, mentors, Head of Departments (HODs), and Career Development Cell (CDC) members.

